* The administrator's Scheduled jobs page: the administrator's own scheduled jobs (Task Scheduler tasks only an administrator can register, S.102 stage 4) and
* which commands each account may run from the command line (S.102 stage 1; owner, 1 Nov 2026: "a cron management admin pane - so that cron can be managed from
* within SD").  An administrator app.
