* The Jobs view's explanation; the selected job first when the output pane leaves few rows
jobs.effect:
   sel = ''
   if jn > 0 then
      if jbad<ji> # '' then
         sel = 'Selected: ' : jnm<ji> : ' is damaged (' : jbad<ji> : ').  C writes it again, D deletes it; it cannot be run.'
